sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-chindapol-coral-flow> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-chindapol-coral-flow-parameter-expressivity> .
